IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. F01-MISSING-FILE-CHECK.
*> Handles missing input file (status 35) without abending.
*> Sets RETURN-CODE to 4 on missing file, 16 on other errors.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT DAILY-TXN-FILE ASSIGN TO "daily_txn.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-TXN-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  DAILY-TXN-FILE.
01  TXN-REC             PIC X(80).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TXN-STATUS       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    OPEN INPUT DAILY-TXN-FILE

    EVALUATE WS-TXN-STATUS
        WHEN "00"
            DISPLAY "FILE OPENED SUCCESSFULLY"
            CLOSE DAILY-TXN-FILE
            MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
        WHEN "35"
            DISPLAY "WARN: INPUT FILE MISSING (STATUS=35)"
            MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "ERR: FILE OPEN FAILED STATUS="
                    WS-TXN-STATUS
            MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
    END-EVALUATE
    STOP RUN.
